{{also|Schwänz}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|swanz}}, from {{m|gmh|swanzen||to swing}}, derived from {{m|gmh|swanken}}, whence modern {{cog|de|schwanken||to wobble}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃvan(t)s/|[ʃʋänts]|[ʃʋäns]|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Schwanz.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|ants|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Schwanzes|Schwänze|Schwänzchen}}

# A [[tail]].
# {{lb|de|informal|mildly|vulgar}} a [[cock]], a [[penis]].
# {{lb|de|derogatory|of a person}} A [[prick]].
#: ''Was will der '''Schwanz''' von mir?''
#:: What does this '''prick''' want from me?

